WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.092
Interpersonal and communication skills are

2
00:00:03.092 --> 00:00:04.868
in the CSAT syllabus.

3
00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:05.815
When they come up,

4
00:00:05.815 --> 00:00:06.782
they test judgment,

5
00:00:06.782 --> 00:00:07.861
not trivia.

6
00:00:08.186 --> 00:00:10.588
A good response is respectful

7
00:00:10.588 --> 00:00:12.078
honest, and practical.

8
00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.324
It moves the problem forward.

9
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.143
Options that escalate,

10
00:00:16.143 --> 00:00:17.948
ignore the issue or pass

11
00:00:17.948 --> 00:00:19.447
the problem to someone else,

12
00:00:19.447 --> 00:00:20.864
are rarely right.

13
00:00:21.537 --> 00:00:23.411
The same instinct helps in

14
00:00:23.411 --> 00:00:25.116
GS4 case studies.

15
00:00:25.116 --> 00:00:25.904
Listen first,

16
00:00:25.904 --> 00:00:27.841
then act within the rules.

17
00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:29.343
Your turn.

18
00:00:29.343 --> 00:00:31.075
What's the most constructive first

19
00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:31.915
step?
